<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Claim Form</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        .header-logo {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            right: 60px;
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .address-block {
            font-size: 10pt;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .form-row > div {
            flex: 1;
            padding-right: 20px;
        }
        .form-label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            font-weight: normal;
        }
        .input-field {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            min-width: 150px;
            padding: 2px 0;
        }
        .checkbox-group label {
            font-weight: normal;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }
        .disclaimer {
            font-size: 9pt;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .signature-line {
            margin-top: 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .signature-block {
            width: 45%;
        }
        .signature-block div {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .table-header {
            font-weight: bold;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 5px 0;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .table-row td {
            padding: 5px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #000;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .table-row td:first-child {
            width: 30%;
        }
        .table-row td:last-child {
            width: 15%;
        }
        .radio-group label {
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="address-block">
        Post Office Box {{ address_zip_code }}<br>
        {{ address_city }}, {{ address_state }} {{ address_zip_code }}<br>
        Phone: {{ phone_number }} &times; Fax: {{ fax_number }}<br>
        groupclaimfiling@aflac.com
    </div>
    <div class="header-logo">Aflac</div>

    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 50px;">CRITICAL ILLNESS CLAIM FORM INSTRUCTIONS</h1>

    <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">To avoid delays in processing of your claim form, complete each section attaching documentation below when it applies.</p>

    <h2 class="section-title">Supporting Documentation Needed</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
        <li>Chart Note to include admission and discharge paperwork if there was a hospital stay</li>
        <li>Surgical Report-if surgery took place</li>
        <li>Pathologist report when diagnosed with a malignant condition</li>
        <li>Benefit Assignment-Benefits are payable to the policy holder unless written authorization is received from you or your healthcare provider to assign benefits to the provider. If you choose to assign benefits, attach a signed and written request.</li>
        <li>Email form to <span data-field="claim_email">{{ claim_email }}</span> or fax to 1.866.849.2970.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">POLICYHOLDER/CLAIMANT INFORMATION</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Employer's Name:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ employer_name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Policy/Certificate No.:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ policy_number }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Social Security No.:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ ssn }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Birth:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ dob }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Gender:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ gender }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Policyholder's Name:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ policyholder_name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Policyholder's Address, City, State, Zip Code:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ policyholder_address }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Policyholder's E-Mail:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ policyholder_email }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Telephone Number:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ phone_number }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">PATIENT'S INFORMATION</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Patient's Name:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ patient_name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Relationship To The Policyholder:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ relationship_to_policyholder }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Birth:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ patient_dob }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Gender:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ patient_gender }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer">
        *By providing your e-mail address above, you consent to the use of electronic transactions in connection with your CAIC policies, contracts, and/or accounts to the extent available and permitted by law (which may include, but not limited to: invoices, claim correspondence, contracts, surveys, and other materials that CAIC is, or may be, legally required to deliver to you).
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">DIAGNOSIS INFORMATION</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Cancer/Carcinoma in Situ:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit a copy of the pathology report from which the condition was diagnosed.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">ILLNESS/CONDITION DETAILS</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Heart Attack:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit a copy of the discharge summary, cardiology consult report, cardiac catheterization report, history & physical, and ER notes.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Coronary Artery Bypass Surgery:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit a copy of the operative report for the procedure.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Major Organ Transplant:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit a copy of the operative report for the procedure.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Stroke:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit a copy of the discharge summary, MRI and/or CT test reports from the initial diagnosis, as well as proof of permanent neurological damage (i.e. follow up CT and/or MRI reports, office notes from neurologists or therapist, etc.).</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Renal Failure:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit proof of the start date for dialysis or the operative report for transplant. The End Stage Renal Disease Medical Evidence Report is preferred.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Heart Event:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit a copy of the operative report for the procedure.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Loss of Sight, speech, hearing, coma, burns, paralysis:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Please submit medical documentation from the health care provider indicating the diagnosis and severity.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        **Disclaimer: Some of the conditions and services listed may not be covered by your policy.
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Dates:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ dates_range }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">To and From:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ dates_range_to_from }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Round Trip Mileage:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ mileage }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 30px;">ATTENDING PHYSICIAN'S STATEMENT</h1>

    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Patient's Name:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ attending_patient_name }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Birth:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ attending_patient_dob }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">DIAGNOSIS AND TREATMENT</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">When did signs and/or symptoms first appear?</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ onset_date }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Has the patient ever received medical advice or treatment for this or a similar condition?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="prior_treatment" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="prior_treatment" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Diagnosis (including complications):</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ diagnosis }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">CANCER/CARCINOMA IN SITU</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Diagnosis (the date the pathological specimen(s) were obtained):</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ cancer_diagnosis_date }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Was the cancer/carcinoma in situ diagnosed pathologically?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="pathological_diagnosis" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="pathological_diagnosis" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Was the cancer/carcinoma in situ diagnosed clinically?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="clinical_diagnosis" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="clinical_diagnosis" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        IF THE CANCER/CARCINOMA IN SITU WAS PATHOLOGICALLY DIAGNOSED, ATTACH A COPY OF THE PATHOLOGY REPORT. IF THE CANCER/CARCINOMA IN SITU WAS CLINICALLY DIAGNOSED, PROVIDE THE REASONS THAT PATHOLOGICAL DIAGNOSIS WAS NOT OBTAINED AND ATTACH MEDICAL EVIDENCE THAT SUPPORTS THE DIAGNOSIS OF CANCER.
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION (HEART ATTACK)</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Does the patient's condition meet all of the following criteria:</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="mi_criteria_met" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="mi_criteria_met" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Were cardiac enzymes elevated?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="enzymes_elevated" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="enzymes_elevated" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Did diagnostic studies confirm a myocardial infarction and the occlusion of one or more coronary arteries?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="diagnostic_studies" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="diagnostic_studies" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Did the patient have chest pain consistent with myocardial infarction?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="chest_pain" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="chest_pain" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">CORONARY ARTERY BYPASS SURGERY</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Was the patient operated on for coronary artery bypass surgery?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="bypass_surgery" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="bypass_surgery" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">MAJOR ORGAN TRANSPLANT</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Did the patient undergo surgery to receive a human heart, liver, lung, kidney, pancreas, or bone marrow?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="transplant_surgery" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="transplant_surgery" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">STROKE</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Did the patient have a stroke, meaning apoplexy, secondary to rupture or acute occlusion of a cerebral artery?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="stroke_event" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="stroke_event" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">RENAL FAILURE</div>
    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Does the patient have end stage renal failure presenting as chronic, irreversible failure to function of both kidneys?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="esrf_present" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="esrf_present" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Does the patient's kidney failure necessitate regular renal dialysis, hemodialysis or peritoneal dialysis (at least weekly) or which results in kidney transplantation?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="dialysis_needed" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="dialysis_needed" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Diagnosis (the date a doctor or physician recommends that the patient begin renal dialysis):</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ renal_diagnosis_date }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date the patient first treated for signs or symptoms of this condition:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ renal_treatment_date }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">ATTENDING PHYSICIAN'S STATEMENT (continued)</div>

    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Is the patient unable to perform job duties?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="unable_to_perform_job" value="yes"> Yes</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="unable_to_perform_job" value="no"> No</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">If yes, please provide dates:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ unable_to_perform_job_dates }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">What specific job duties is patient unable to perform?</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ unable_job_duties }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Restrictions and Limitations: (Please quantify in hours, weight, etc.)</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ restrictions_limitations }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Is the patient:</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="patient_status" value="ambulatory"> Ambulatory</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="patient_status" value="bed_confined"> Bed Confined</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="patient_status" value="house_confined"> House Confined</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">If yes, Hospital Address:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ hospital_address }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date admitted:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ admission_date }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date discharged:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ discharge_date }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date you expect patient to resume partial duties?</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ partial_duty_date }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date you expect patient to resume full duties?</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ full_duty_date }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">If patient is unemployed or retired, on what date would you expect a person of like age, gender and good health to resume his/her normal and necessary activities?</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ return_to_normal_date }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Was the patient treated by any other physician's for this condition?</span>
            <div class="radio-group">
                <label><input type="radio" name="other_physician" value="no"> No</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="other_physician" value="yes"> Yes</label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">If yes, provide names and addresses of other treating physicians:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ other_physician_details }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        Remember, it is unlawful to fill out this form with facts you know are false or to leave out facts you know are relevant and important. Check to be sure that all information is accurate and complete.
    </div>

    <div class="signature-line">
        <div class="signature-block">
            <span class="form-label">I hereby certify that the above described information is based upon reasonable medical probability and is true and correct to the best of my knowledge and belief.</span>
            <div>Name (Attending Physician) Please Print: {{ physician_name }}</div>
            <div>Degree: {{ physician_degree }}</div>
            <div>Telephone Number: {{ physician_phone }}</div>
            <div>Address: {{ physician_address }}</div>
            <div>City: {{ physician_city }}</div>
            <div>State: {{ physician_state }}</div>
            <div>Zip code: {{ physician_zip }}</div>
            <div>Signature: </div>
            <div>Date: {{ physician_date }}</div>
            <div>Medical ID#: {{ physician_id }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 30px;">AUTHORIZATION TO OBTAIN INFORMATION</h1>

    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Send to:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Continental American Insurance Company</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Phone:</span>
            <div class="input-field">(800) 433-3036</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Post Office Box:</span>
            <div class="input-field">84075</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Fax:</span>
            <div class="input-field">(866) 849-2970</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">City, State, Zip:</span>
            <div class="input-field">Columbus, GA 31993</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Email:</span>
            <div class="input-field">groupclaimfiling@aflac.com</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Primary Certificate Holder Name:</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">SSN(optional):</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ primary_holder_ssn }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Birth:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ primary_holder_dob }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 20px;">Certificate Number(s):</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Address:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ primary_holder_address }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">City:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ primary_holder_city }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">State:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ primary_holder_state }}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Zip:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ primary_holder_zip }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 20px;">Name of Individual Subject to Disclosure (if not the primary Certificate Holder):</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <span class="form-label">Date of Birth:</span>
            <div class="input-field">{{ subject_dob }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 20px;">Relationship to Primary Certificate Holder:</div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <div style="flex: 1;">
            <div class="checkbox-group">
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="relationship_self" value="self"> Self</label>
